# =====================================================================================
# GROUND-TRUTH-DERIVED, PLUMBING TEST ONLY.
# PROVISIONAL – for Rohit's review, not flight-approved. SIMULATION ONLY.
# ExternalNav input comes from tools/externalnav_stub_GROUND_TRUTH_PLUMBING_ONLY.py, which is
# Gazebo ground truth plus synthetic noise and drift. It MUST be replaced by Doshi's SLAM odometry
# (docs/interfaces/odometry_to_ardupilot.md) and must never be used as the navigation solution.
# =====================================================================================
# Visual odometry over MAVLink (ODOMETRY / VISION_POSITION_ESTIMATE)
VISO_TYPE       1
# EKF3 source set 1: horizontal position, velocity and yaw from ExternalNav (6);
# height from the barometer (1); no vertical-velocity source (GPS is disabled).
EK3_SRC1_POSXY  6
EK3_SRC1_VELXY  6
EK3_SRC1_YAW    6
EK3_SRC1_POSZ   1
EK3_SRC1_VELZ   0
# No GPS: no driver, and the SITL GPS simulation is disabled.
GPS1_TYPE       0
SIM_GPS_DISABLE 1
# VISO_* noise, compass and FS_EKF_* are left at ArduPilot defaults for this plumbing test.
